@baseUrl = http://localhost:5127

### 1. First call: Cache MISS (Hits simulated database)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productscache/1
Accept: application/json

### 2. Second call: Cache HIT (Returns immediately from L1 MemoryCache)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productscache/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Check stats (TotalDbQueries should be 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productscache/stats
Accept: application/json

### 4. Simulate database failure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/productscache/simulate-failure?enabled=true
Accept: application/json

### 5. Call again with failure active (FusionCache Fail-Safe returns cached data!)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productscache/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Restore database simulation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/productscache/simulate-failure?enabled=false
Accept: application/json

### 7. Evict cache for item 1
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/productscache/1

### 8. Call again after eviction (Hits database again, TotalDbQueries becomes 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productscache/1
Accept: application/json
